### 💡 What’s New

| Feature                       | Description                                                           |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Active DE5 Row Tracking**   | MCU sends “`ROW=3`” messages; the Python GUI displays the current row |
| **Torque/Efficiency Overlay** | Plots the DE5 parameter curve and highlights the active point         |
| **Live 2-panel plot**         | Top = real-time telemetry; Bottom = DE5 param space                   |
| **CSV output**                | Logs time, current, voltage, and active row                           |

